mpared as static mesh data. Let me check `_ANIMATION_TOPOLOGY_FIELDS`.\n\nAlso note: `_apply_animation_item` updates positions via `handle.update_positions(mesh.positions)` — does update_positions recompute normals? Probably not; normals are static. So if normals change, must rebuild. Adding normals to the static comparison fields fixes it.\n\nLet me read the field definitions.", "summary": []}
